      "introduced_text": "# SpellDisplay supplied-result RED — 2026-10-13\n\n## Retail saved RED\n\nAt input stage `85b5494d2`, **0 PASS / 9 FAIL, actual wait exit101, 1.55s**. [Independent saved-execution report](red-current/independent/retail-genuine-red/report.md) and [complete proof](red-current/independent/retail-genuine-red/proof.json) verify nine seeded cases reaching `missing supplied SpellDisplay record` after the callable guard. Exact returned value/arity is not exposed. Complete snapshots, numeric/secret behavior, feed callbacks and cached consumer construction/lifecycle remain unreached; this is not nine downstream defects or GREEN.\n\nThe runtime unit name includes `green`; actual result controls classification. Compilation is separate: **741 JSON records, terminal0, six manifest deprecations, zero compiler-message records**, 4m49s. [Existing new-copy authentication receipt](red-current/retail/epoch/receipt-integration.json) and [authentication report](red-current/retail/epoch/auth-report.md) are retained as TEXT; later execution reused stat metadata without reauthentication. Source archive, external libraries, caches and settings are not independently authenticated.\n\n## Passive source and limits\n\n[Input-stage source report](red-current/independent/input-source/report.md) owns complete passive14-field outer/16-field nested DTOs, environment-local map, schema-correct type13 feed, generated test wiring and first-result ordering. Scoped formatting/source checks PASS; consumer loading helper's side-effect naming finding remains OPEN. [Contract](../../../../docs/specs/ui-widget-spell-display.md) owns requirements and later proof status. Getter/query/serializer producer remains absent.\n\nPinned Retail/PTR declarations specify SpellDisplay13, DoubleStateIconRow14 and numeric border/tint enums, not supplied RGBA objects. No world-loot click/pip/list, native catalog/transport/rendering, all-profile or full-parent acceptance.\n\n## PTR admission and selected retention\n\nInitial [PTR admission](red-current/ptr/initial-denied-admission.json) denied: **zero launches**, not behavioral RED. Separate freshly admitted retry compilation is pending and not part of this packet.\n\n[Selection manifest](red-current/retention-manifest.json): **32 complete TEXT payloads / 635,547 public bytes**. All selected source, compiler, authentication and runtime streams plus complete independent reports retained without clipping or JSON-pointer omissions. Ordered privacy mapping remains private mode0600. New selected retention/privacy/link integrity gate **PENDING**, distinct from independent saved-runtime/source proof. Private originals and historical outcomes remain unchanged; Git history is not erased. Parent OPEN."
    },
